INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web) VALUES (66, 12, 'Run the skeleton from a clean checkout and check it against the documents', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-14, AGENTS.md. Clean clone of main (786c050) in /tmp, every AGENTS.md command run from a clean environment (env -i; the inherited direnv shell is task 68: scripts/test fails when started from an inherited luv dev-shell environment), warm Nix store: nix develop 3 s; nix build 3 s cached, 11 s for the game''s image (nix build --rebuild; reports the SBCL image as non-deterministic, harmless); nix run opened the 1280x800 window, closed cleanly on kill by PID; scripts/test 5 s, 23 passed; scripts/screenshot out.png 2.5 s, 1280x800, lit Earth, stars and PLACEHOLDER(23) label; ./sly start 4.5 s cold (fresh build/, 411 MB); ./sly status 1 s; ./sly screenshot before ./sly play errors ''Nothing is playing: ./sly play first'', after play (1.3 s) 1 s, window-size PNG with the scene and label; ./sly eval of a red earth-fragment define-frame-shader in LUV-IN-SPACE.SHADERS 1 s, the next screenshot showed the red Earth; ./sly stop-playing, ./sly stop 1 s, no process left; nix flake check 16 s, all checks passed. Skeleton against docs/architecture.md: flake input pinned to 6abc9d1 with nixpkgs following luv''s (decision 1: How the game consumes luv), dev shell with pm and git, check on the slim environment, launcher/build/dev shell/check unset LD_LIBRARY_PATH; systems luv-in-space (depends on luv only), luv-in-space/program, luv-in-space/tests (luv/test-support, parachute); packages luv-in-space, luv-in-space.shaders (uses luv.shader), luv-in-space.tests; src files package, shaders, scene, main, capture in that order; PLACEHOLDER(23) in scene.lisp, shaders.lisp and on screen; report-failed-live-artifacts, live artifacts refreshed in draw, depth-view, capture-scene, screenshot-main, the offscreen-frame centre-pixel test: all agree. Changed: AGENTS.md times (./sly start ~8 s -> ~5 s cold; nix flake check ~16 s added; nix build ~11 s when only the game''s image builds) and that ./sly screenshot needs ./sly play and has the window''s size. Not changed: the stale ''~5 s warm'' comment in scripts/screenshot (skeleton changed only for failing commands).', 'Follow the "Ground rules for every task" of `plan 12: consistency check and sign-off`: fix small, already-decided mismatches in the documents yourself and cite the decision or section; a fix that changes a lasting choice supersedes its decision with `pm decision record` and updates every document citing it; a gap too large becomes a follow-up task in plan 12; work only a later milestone can do goes into `docs/design.md` "Scope"; no game features. End with a short list of what you checked and what you changed in the done note.

The skeleton is changed only to fix a command that fails; a fix that isn''t small is a follow-up task in this plan.

