- Tests: the plan''s list (round trip within 1e-15 from a fixed seed list, FRD signs for pitch/yaw/roll, slerp at 0, ½, 1, `relative-single` 1.25 exactly, symmetric inverse within 1e-15).

Done when: `scripts/test` passes; `./sly eval ''(quat-rotate (quat-from-axis-angle (vec3 0 1 0) 0.1d0) (vec3 1 0 0))'' --package LUV-IN-SPACE` gives a vector with negative z.', '2026-10-14T22:55:05Z', '2026-10-14T23:09:48Z', 82, 0);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web) VALUES (93, 13, 'units.lisp: constants, calendar, display conversions', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-14, src/units.lisp, tests/units.lisp, luv-in-space.asd, docs/architecture.md (''Time'', ''Files in load order'', ''Rails, orbits and frames'' Units line), AGENTS.md Layout. Deviation from the plan: J2000.0 is 11:58:50.816 in the game''s UTC, not 11:58:55.816, since decision 14 fixes TT - UTC at 69.184 s for every date (recorded as a consequence of decision 14). The mu digits are taken from docs/architecture.md; task 95 checks them against DE440.', 'Piece 2 of `plan 13: Simulation foundations: math, units, bodies, orbits`: write `src/units.lisp` and `tests/units.lisp` as the plan''s section "2. `units.lisp`" lists them (`decision 14: Units and time epoch`, `decision 66: Calendar dates on the 1/64 s grid`).

- Files: `src/units.lisp`, `tests/units.lisp` (new); `luv-in-space.asd` (both systems, after `math`); `docs/architecture.md` "Time" (grid rounding and `(start-t)`); `AGENTS.md` "Layout" `src/` bullet kept true.
- Contents: every constant of the plan''s list with its source in a comment beside it (μ of Sun, Earth, Moon from DE440; IAU radii; J2; g₀; ε; AU; TT − UTC; day, Julian century; `+fine-step+` = 1/64 s); calendar `utc->t` (Fliegel–Van Flandern, integer days and seconds apart), `utc->grid-t`, `t->utc`, `*start-date*` (2040 1 1 0 0 0), `start-t`, `t->ut1-days`, `t->julian-centuries`; display conversions (km, km/s, degrees, duration fields, `format-utc`).
- Tests: the plan''s list (J2000.0 within 1e-9 s of 0, round trips, `(start-t)` on the grid and within 1/128 s, `format-utc` of the start and a day later, start inside 1800–2050, degree/radian round trip).
- Piece 4 (`bodies.lisp` ephemerides) checks the μ digits against Park et al. 2021 with web access; write them here from `docs/architecture.md` "Units".

Done when: `scripts/test` passes; every constant in `units.lisp` cites a source.', '2026-10-14T22:55:05Z', '2026-10-14T23:11:39Z', 82, 0);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web) VALUES (94, 13, 'bodies.lisp part one: bodies, rotations, body-fixed frames', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-14, src/bodies.lisp, tests/bodies.lisp (new), luv-in-space.asd, docs/architecture.md (Files in load order), AGENTS.md (Layout). Body list with Laplace spheres (Earth 9.246e8 m from the EMB a = 1.00000261 AU of Standish Table 1, Moon 6.618e7 m from a = 384,399 km); Earth Rotation Angle with whole UT1 days dropped before the multiply; Moon and Sun IAU WGCCRE 2015 leading terms; body-fixed-matrix takes a key or a body. scripts/test passes (557).', 'Piece 3 of `plan 13: Simulation foundations: math, units, bodies, orbits`: start `src/bodies.lisp` and `tests/bodies.lisp` as the plan''s section "3. `bodies.lisp`, part one" lists them. Needs pieces 1 and 2 (`math.lisp`, `units.lisp`).

